{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذْ", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "قُلْتُمْ", "translation": "you said"}, {"text": "يَـٰمُوسَىٰ", "translation": "O Musa"}, {"text": "لَن", "translation": "Never"}, {"text": "نُّؤْمِنَ", "translation": "(will) we believe"}, {"text": "لَكَ", "translation": "in you"}, {"text": "حَتَّىٰ", "translation": "until"}, {"text": "نَرَى", "translation": "we see"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "جَهْرَةًۭ", "translation": "manifestly"}, {"text": "فَأَخَذَتْكُمُ", "translation": "So seized you"}, {"text": "ٱلصَّـٰعِقَةُ", "translation": "the thunderbolt"}, {"text": "وَأَنتُمْ", "translation": "while you"}, {"text": "تَنظُرُونَ", "translation": "(were) looking"}], "sahih": "And [recall] when you said, \"O Moses, we will never believe you until we see Allāh outright\"; so the thunderbolt took you while you were looking on."}